        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ELI-EBE, Elizabeth Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Elizabeth Handleset is a great choice if you are looking for a glamorous way to introduce visitors to your home. The front door is like a first impression, it tells the story of what sort of people live in a house. The Ornate Elizabeth Entrance Set was designed to fit standard doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available with your choice of 6 beautiful knobs and levers. Choose from a single cylinder or a full dummy handleset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Elizabeth Handleset with Matching Elizabeth Interior Escutcheon:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Escutcheon Elizabeth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Latch Bore: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch Bore to Center of Thrubolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Height: 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Elizabeth Entrance Set",
                "description": "The Elizabeth Handleset is a great choice if you are looking for a glamorous way to introduce visitors to your home. The front door is like a first impression, it tells the story of what sort of people live in a house. The Ornate Elizabeth Entrance Set was designed to fit standard doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 2-1/2 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available with your choice of 6 beautiful knobs and levers. Choose from a single cylinder or a full dummy handleset.",
                "keywords": "traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets,  single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Arched Elizabeth Entrysets, Baldwin ELI-EBE,Ornate Elizabeth Entrance Sets, BAL-ELI-EBE, Elizabeth Handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Collection 3/4 Escutcheon Elizabeth Handlesets, Elizabeth Handleset with Traditional Arch Roses, Elizabeth egress Handleset, panic proof handlesets, Elizabeth Handleset with Matching Elizabeth Interior Escutcheon"
